{"id": "1791463", "name": "הרכבת פונקציות עם פונקציה מקוטעת – ביטוי, תחום ותמונה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "comp", "params": ["g", "f", "x"], "body": "at(g,x=f)"}, {"name": "gg", "params": ["x"], "body": "mm * x + nn"}, {"name": "ff1", "params": ["x"], "body": "ffs[ii]"}, {"name": "ff2", "params": ["x"], "body": "ffs[jj]"}, {"name": "ff3", "params": ["x"], "body": "ffs[kk]"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הרכבת פונקציות – פונקציה מקוטעת</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:0 0 6px\">כל אחד מששת הרכיבים נבדק בנפרד</p><p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle f \\)</span> מוגדרת בשלושה קטעים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:0}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right) \\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:3}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:2}},{{CT:4}}\\right) \\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:5}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:4}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[  \\displaystyle g\\left(x\\right)={{CT:7}}  \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\circ g \\)</span></div><p>תחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle g \\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle \\left[{{CT:8}},{{CT:9}}\\right] \\)</span>, ותמונתה היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle \\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:8}},{{CT:10}}\\right) \\):&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle h_1\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:10}},{{CT:11}}\\right) \\):&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle h_2\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:11}},{{CT:9}}\\right] \\):&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle h_3\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle g\\circ f \\)</span></div><p>בסעיף זה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle g:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R} \\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right) \\):&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle k_1\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:2}},{{CT:4}}\\right) \\):&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle k_2\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:4}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\):&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle k_3\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans6]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans6]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בכל ענף של הפונקציה המקוטעת מציבים את הפונקציה השנייה. ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\circ g\\)</span> קטעי התחום משתנים, וב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle g\\circ f\\)</span> הם נשארים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — ההרכבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\circ g \\)</span> (סעיף א׳)</b><br>מציבים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle g\\left(x\\right) \\)</span> בכל אחד מענפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle f \\)</span>. נקודות המעבר מתקבלות מן הערכים שבהם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle g\\left(x\\right)=p_i \\)</span>.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle h_1(x)={{CT:12}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:8}},{{CT:10}}\\right) \\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle h_2(x)={{CT:13}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:10}},{{CT:11}}\\right) \\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle h_3(x)={{CT:14}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:11}},{{CT:9}}\\right] \\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — ההרכבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle g\\circ f \\)</span> (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>מפעילים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle g \\)</span> על כל אחד משלושת ענפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle f \\)</span>, ולכן קטעי התחום נשארים כפי שהם.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle k_1(x)={{CT:15}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right) \\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle k_2(x)={{CT:16}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:2}},{{CT:4}}\\right) \\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\displaystyle k_3(x)={{CT:17}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:4}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords":